    "text": "By NCPR News ,\n1 days ago Zoo New York, in Watertown, has seen a dramatic surge of donations after The New York Times published an article about it last week. The article was titled “A Beloved Zoo of Misfit Animals Is Almost Out of Money.” It highlighted that without funding, animals there could ultimately be euthanized. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
